            <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 15:06:24 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20260717</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in v2.2.2</h2>
                <h3>Bugfixes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Firefly may behave unpredictably when the recordings and or clips folder selected is synced with iCloud Drive. 
                        <ul>
                            <li>This is not a supported configuration, this fix prevents users from selecting a folder snycing with iCloud Drive.</li>
                            <li>If you're currently using an iCloud Drive backed folder we aren't forcing you to change it but we highly recommend taking some time to move it. </li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>For the full detailed changelog please visit <a href="https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html">https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html</a>.</p>
            ]]></description>
